inate is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =2x \\\\  & =2(2) \\\\  & =4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second point is $(2,4).$\n\nFinally, we plot those two points on the $xy$-plane and draw a line through them. This is the graph of $y=2x.$ \n\n![](images/df/dfcd69ef1daa658ef212cb84086227e341dac3c8e57f029ccd77519c66c7507f.png)\n\nAll choices have the same $y$-intercept. Check another point to distinguish the lines."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186702910 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "01eb77c9-0886-5528-a4c6-d9d5581f8210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(6,2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702896}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "01eb77c9-0886-5528-a4c6-d9d5581f8210" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(6,2)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702896} :answer-field/id #uuid "09b639fc-2faf-5158-9f9e-00d1e39d8254" :answer-field/key "point-second" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702898} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "190cdaf4-1d5e-5064-bc60-6ebfbd7937ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/88/88f3274e669b5256758247ef1f5ec00082d9c26fdaeafcc026d0b91f0af754b1.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702903} {:answer/id #uuid "30bfa0fd-fd9c-5060-9daf-b1dd66d392ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/a2/a27f30c29026ec7edb8541d1678bdd07f6248f9346bc044cd0f562db99c67cf0.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702911} {:answer/id #uuid "32d5126a-28d5-5198-b960-a6005667d2aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045497 :db/ident :answer.type/image} :answer/value "images/d9/d9aa24d423a53853a992fdc06f6550722f55e6bc50f48391400f3f50eefdf732.png" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702912} {:answer/id #uuid "7c5382b3-c2ed-53be-b1d8-f1e51c6e39ae" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186