 "We need to find two distinct points that lie on our line. Any two points will do!\n\n- For the first point, we will let the $x$-coordinate be $x=-3.$ Then the $y$-coordinate is \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{1}{3}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(-3) \\\\  & =-1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the first point is $(-3,-1).$\n\n- For the second point, we will let the $x$-coordinate be $x=6.$ Then the $y$-coordinate is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}y & =\\frac{1}{3}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{3}(6) \\\\  & =2.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSo, the second point is $(6,2).$\n\nFinally, we plot those two points on the $xy$-plane and draw a line through them. This is the graph of $y=\\frac{1}{3}x.$ \n\n![](images/a7/a7ee4360ef9e4466005d2ff3652357f804c057a4645653eaafde9adf2dc5886f.png)\n\nAll choices have the same $y$-intercept. Check another point to distinguish the lines."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186702913 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14d0ecb6-5b3f-5220-82cc-af98e7f64a48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-2,1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702900}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "14d0ecb6-5b3f-5220-82cc-af98e7f64a48" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(-2,1)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702900} :answer-field/id #uuid "1f87b5e5-a493-50cc-ba9c-ced348d165d8" :answer-field/key "point-first" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702905} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24443bc4-51e7-550a-b4a2-525ff174f6d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2,-3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702907}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24443bc4-51e7-550a-b4a2-525ff174f6d3" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "(2,-3)" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186702907} :answer-field/id #uuid "78b04e30-512d-5a0